        "text_RgAwrc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>Making Sofas Easier, From Day One</h4><p>Buying a sofa online shouldn’t feel like a project.<br/><br/>But for a long time, it did.</p><p>Heavy boxes. Complicated assembly. Expensive delivery.<br/><br/>And that moment when the sofa doesn’t fit through the door, the lift, or the corner of your hallway.</p><p>We’ve been there ourselves. That’s exactly why OZDESIGN SOFA exists.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
