      "blocks": {
        "heading_8jr3Nm": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The Problem With Most Sofas",
            "title_highlight_color": "#6d388b",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_8EQ8BK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Even brands that focus on affordability often miss a few key things:</p><ul><li>Delivery costs are high because of wasted space<br/></li><li>Assembly can be complicated and frustrating<br/></li><li>Customisation is limited or not available at all<br/></li></ul><p>Sofas are supposed to make your home more comfortable, not add more work to your life.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
      },
